  "description": "Pull the sand. Fill the pits. Clear the board.\n\nDive into a satisfying puzzle experience where colorful sand flows with real physics and every move shapes the board.\n\nIn this relaxing yet strategic puzzle game, your goal is to clear the level before time runs out. The grid is filled with colorful sand blocks and Tetris-shaped pits waiting to be filled. By pulling the correct colored sand toward the matching pits, you create smooth flows that drop, shift, and settle naturally thanks to dynamic sand physics.\n\nWatch the sand cascade, fill the shapes perfectly, and trigger satisfying movements as the board clears.\n\nAs you progress, levels introduce more complex layouts, tighter time limits, and smarter puzzles that challenge your planning and timing.",
